| voucher | testemunho | ejemplar de referencia | spesimen bukti |
| tissue | tecido | tejido | jaringan |
| preparation | preparação | preparación | preparasi |
| tag / label | etiqueta | etiqueta | label |
| coordinate | coordenada | coordenada | koordinat |
| habitat | habitat | hábitat | habitat |
| trap line | linha de armadilhas | línea de trampas | jalur perangkap |
| pitfall trap | armadilha de queda | trampa de caída | perangkap sumuran |
| mist net | rede de neblina | red de niebla | jaring kabut |

## Translation workflow

The steps for producing and reviewing a translation are on the
[Documentation](../docs#adding-a-new-language-translation) page.

Every page under a non-English locale shows an **AI-assisted translation**
notice under its title. Adding `authors` to that page's front matter switches
the notice to the reviewed state and names the reviewers:

```yaml
---
title: "Página traduzida"
authors:
  - Reviewer Name
---
```

Add `authors` only after a person has read the translation against the English
source and corrected it. Until then, the unreviewed notice is the honest label.
